cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the GMEOW Guides slice, please cite GMEOW as below."
title: "GMEOW Guides Module"
abstract: >-
  The pedagogy and adoption-guides slice of the GMEOW ontology (core tier). It
  models task-oriented adoption recipes (gmeow:Recipe) and curated learning paths
  (gmeow:LearningPath) as first-class GMEOW individuals that sequence canonical
  example files, vocabulary terms, and follow-on reading for a developer adopting
  GMEOW. These curated guides were formerly hardcoded in the documentation tooling;
  dogfooding them here makes them authored-once GMEOW data, sourced through the slice
  catalog and projected outward into the ontology documentation site.
type: dataset
